<title>USA: US to challenge Philippines over pork at WTO.</title>
<headline>US to challenge Philippines over pork at WTO.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Trade Representative-designate Charlene Barshefsky said Monday the United States would file a complaint against the Philippines over pork sales at the World Trade Organization.</p>
<p>Barshefsky said the complaint would be filed Tuesday in Geneva, where the WTO dispute settlement body was due to meet.</p>
<p>She also said the United States would seek WTO consultation in a dispute over U.S. rice and barley exports to the European Union.</p>
</text>
